# ── Hygiene: local agent / l10n-sweep scratch output (D10) ────────────────
# Catch-all for the *.txt / *.json scratch output the l10n-sweep and
# golden-fix loops leave in this directory (debug.py,
# find_missing_keys.py, group_failures.py, test_v*.txt,
# test_pre_commit.txt, etc.).
#
# CMP-025 (audit batch 18, 2026-09-02): the two files
# `analyze_out.txt` (87K flutter analyze log) and `analyze_waiver.txt`
# (waived-rule list) were committed to the repo root in earlier
# PRs before this catch-all existed. They have been `git rm`'d in
# the CMP-025 commit. New analyzer output should be written to
# `build/analyzer/` or piped to a temp file OUTSIDE the repo —
# see the AUDIT_HYGIENE.md batch 18 receipt for the full rationale.
*.txt
*.json
debug.py
find_missing_keys.py
group_failures.py
